{"version":1,"content":"<p>今晨（22日）8時許，屯門鳴琴輕鐵站對開有兩輛九巴相撞，警方及消防接報有多人受傷。</p><p>救援人員趕至現場，意外中9人受傷，包括兩名巴士車長，傷者全部清醒，分別由救護車送往屯門醫院。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T03:02:40.369781+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":88,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T02:04:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T04:17:53.776931+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T02:58:02.568099+00:00","content_hash":"e0c3fd56373fbfd2a4d0e60268eba4142fd65363e34f739e599ab7b0e7624d7f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}